    <string name="help_title">How to use</string>
    <string name="help_body">Tap Speak (or long-press the app icon → Voice open) and say things like:\n\n• “Open physics notes”\n• “Open lab report pdf”\n• “Open the latest download”\n• “Open the last pdf”\n• “Open today’s photo”\n• “Open chapter 3 slides”\n• “Share the resume pdf”\n\nYou don’t need the exact file name — close is fine. If more than one file fits, the app asks which one.\n\nTap a file to open it. Long-press a file to share it.\n\nSearches your Download folder and all folders inside it.</string>
